stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> valid_queued: valid saved request
  [*] --> corrupt_entry_held: invalid JSON or shape
  [*] --> storage_unavailable: storage access throws
  valid_queued --> submitting: online drain
  submitting --> unknown: interrupted or invalid receipt
  submitting --> refused: matching refusal
  submitting --> accepted: matching acceptance
  unknown --> submitting: reconnect or check receipt
  refused --> submitting: explicit retry only
  accepted --> accepted: late failure ignored
  corrupt_entry_held --> corrupt_entry_held: retain bytes, never submit
  storage_unavailable --> valid_queued: reopen after access restored
  valid_queued --> retired: close
  submitting --> retired: session invalidated
  unknown --> retired: close
  refused --> retired: close
  accepted --> retired: close
  corrupt_entry_held --> retired: close, retain bytes
